    "body": "`definedBy` now only depends on the parameter `NUM_PMP_ENTRIES`. In this repo, machine-mode parameters consistently include `extension: { name: Sm }` in `definedBy` (often combined via `allOf` when additional param gating is needed). Consider switching to `definedBy: { allOf: [ {extension: {name: Sm}}, {param: {name: NUM_PMP_ENTRIES, greaterThan: 0}} ] }` so PMP_GRANULARITY remains explicitly scoped to Sm while also being gated on NUM_PMP_ENTRIES > 0 (matching patterns like ARCH_ID_VALUE.yaml).\n```suggestion\n  allOf:\n    - extension:\n        name: Sm\n    - param:\n        name: NUM_PMP_ENTRIES\n        greaterThan: 0\n```",
